{
  "name": "Prof Lukoye Atwoli elected as a member of the CINP Councillors",
  "parent_id": 203314579422926,
  "group_id": "b2aba384-dde4-41e7-a187-d618c9330fa1",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:44:56.381Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-31T09:44:56.458Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-31T09:44:56.444Z",
  "id": 203986929208084,
  "uuid": "8946db4c-3887-4a4d-a980-c6cd47f32355",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "a54d02d0-784f-b5ff-670d-2d24e0a7ae58",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "3fae1458-1cb7-cdd7-4022-de17077ddb8f",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The CINP is the global platform for Neuropsychopharmacology, a branch of science that examines the effects of drugs on the mind. It combines neuroscience with the science of psychopharmacology, which studies how different drugs impact people's behaviour.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The organization has an Executive Committee and a Council which includes leadership and knowledge in psychopharmacology from around the world, who are nominated by the members and serve as an officer of the College for a minimum of 4 years.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Speaking while accepting the appointment, Prof Atwoli said, \"It is a great pleasure and honour to me and to the AKU family to be elected as one of the CINP Councillors. I look forward to collaborating with my colleagues at CINP and contributing to the advancement of Neuropsychopharmacology standards for the benefit of all.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The CINP membership includes psychiatrists, pharmacologists and other basic scientists, and research psychologists. The organization holds regular meetings in form of trainings, educational programs, international meetings, and world congresses and reaches interested researchers all over the world.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "According to a statement by the President of CINP, Prof Kazutaka Ikeda said, \"We are pleased to confirm that Prof Atwoli has been elected as one of the CINP Councillors. We believe his experience, expertise, and enthusiasm will be of great benefit to CINP, and we look forward to working with him.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Prof Atwoli leads and participates in mental health research locally and globally. He is a member of the WHO World Mental Health Surveys Consortium, which is the leading collaborative project in psychiatric epidemiology globally. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In addition, he was appointed by the President of Kenya as the inaugural Chair of the Board for Mathari National Teaching and Referral Hospital. He also serves as the Secretary-General of the African Association of Psychiatrists and President of the African College of Neuropsychopharmacology. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
